userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: For 0 < x < π/2, the areas sin x/2 ≤ x/2 ≤ tan x/2 sandwich the circular sector between two triangles, which forces sin x / x → 1 as x → 0.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): The sector is literally trapped between two triangles built from the same angle, so its area x/2 is trapped between sin x/2 and tan x/2 — and as the trap tightens, sin x / x has nowhere to go but 1.
DEMO STEPS: 5 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

